r_Image.png", "id": "312168831019492", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982568_312168834352825_6277306082782742390_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_aAQnO_jamAQ7kNvwFlAVvE&_nc_oc=AdpsDXN88LWCmyZ-gg5pbqJrZNDki2ABKVFMmC_rSNGf7znlotOQ63Bvc-XWeGhH2IU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR0u70moyRtzhf8zg6VQ4p8h9jJMk_Z3yhFzFndQq30DA&oe=6AFC9579"}, "display_name": "OneXR VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Organizations across the world, especially the manufacturing companies, experience difficulty in obtaining expertise for selling & marketing machines digitally, and have to depend on traditional methods of marketing, which result in millions of dollars.\n\nOneXR - VR application enables virtual delivery of contents related to your products for the prospects to help them during the pre-purchase stage, which can work on Oculus VR headset devices. It elevates the level of service a user receives without worrying about the impact of geographical boundaries.\n\nOneXR VR app has various aspects, in several segments of the business such as Remote Auditing, Sales Enablement, Operational Efficacy, Research & Development, On-boarding & Training and  many more.\n\nHighlights of the OneXR VR App are Product visualization, VR enablement and X-Ray mode simulation.", "short_description": "Redefining immersive product visualization experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/16ckK16yi2MAV_WXHjqlY2TthQnm9spIUs9UTQdj80zI/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Augray LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://onexr.in/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": 